        "title": "The Arithmetic Sum Formula",
        "text": "For an arithmetic series, the sum of the first $n$ terms is:\n$$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}[2a + (n-1)d]$$\n\nOr alternatively:\n$$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}(a + l)$$\nwhere $l$ is the last term.",
