        "title": "Substitute Values",
        "text": "Using $a = 3$, $d = 4$, $n = 50$:\n\n$S_{50} = \\frac{50}{2}[2(3) + (50-1)(4)]$\n\n$S_{50} = 25[6 + 49 \\times 4]$\n\n$S_{50} = 25[6 + 196]$",
